From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:04:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/38] function runner: expose bounded host-operation mismatch
 evidence

Retain data-free operation and status count differences when paired query-shadow host traces do not match. Include comparison eligibility and an exact omission count while keeping matching reports allocation-free and preserving the existing order-insensitive multiset semantics. Expose the bounded diagnostic through authenticated operator evidence so a mismatch can be investigated without retaining invocation data.
